- Edge cases: sale attempted with no open session (configurable block/warn); two cashiers on one register; session left open across days (force close with reason); negative variance and over threshold requires manager PIN; Z-report is immutable and reprintable; refunds reduce expected cash correctly; split payments count only the cash portion; undo of petty cash.

### 1.5 Return stock movements not upserted — [V: pos_inventory]
